<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #16213e); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 30px; }
        .info-box { background: #f8f9fa; border-left: 4px solid #e94560; padding: 15px; margin: 15px 0; border-radius: 0 5px 5px 0; }
        .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1 style="color: #e94560;">Les Eternels</h1>
            <p>Adhesion confirmee !</p>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Bonjour {{ user.firstName }} !</h2>
            <p>Votre adhesion a bien ete enregistree. Voici le recapitulatif :</p>

            <div class="info-box">
                <p><strong>Activite :</strong> {{ membership.activity.name }}</p>
                <p><strong>Date de debut :</strong> {{ membership.startDate|date('d/m/Y') }}</p>
                {% if membership.endDate %}
                    <p><strong>Date de fin :</strong> {{ membership.endDate|date('d/m/Y') }}</p>
                {% endif %}
                <p><strong>Statut :</strong> Actif</p>
            </div>

            <p>Vous pouvez maintenant participer a toutes les activites et evenements lies a cette adhesion.</p>
            <p>Pour toute question, contactez-nous a contact@les-eternels.fr</p>
            <p><strong>L'equipe Les Eternels</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Les Eternels - Association de Jeux | contact@les-eternels.fr</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
